WEBVTT

00:00:07.180 --> 00:00:13.580
A blue sky before the end of the rainy season

00:00:07.180 --> 00:00:13.580
Tsuyu ake mae no aozora wa...

00:00:13.990 --> 00:00:21.500
makes a heart dance with expectation

00:00:13.990 --> 00:00:21.500
hitoashi hayaku kokoro wo odoraseru

00:00:22.920 --> 00:00:28.980
Summer is coming yet again

00:00:22.920 --> 00:00:28.980
Kotoshi mo mosugu natsuga kuru

00:00:29.970 --> 00:00:37.410
The city and people are coming to life bursting with joy

00:00:29.970 --> 00:00:37.410
Machi mo hito mo ukare kibun de zawameki dasu

00:00:38.980 --> 00:00:46.530
A man who's grown up without losing his boyish heart

00:00:38.980 --> 00:00:46.530
Shonen no kokoro no mama otona ni natta hito

00:00:47.030 --> 00:00:55.260
We can't go back to the day we met for the first time, but...

00:00:47.030 --> 00:00:55.260
Futari deatta anohi ni modorenai kedo...

00:00:57.400 --> 00:01:05.000
If I close my eyes, I can see your smiling face

00:00:57.400 --> 00:01:05.000
Hitomi wo tojireba hohoemu kao ga mieru

00:01:05.210 --> 00:01:08.880
The song we both loved. Do you still sing it?

00:01:05.210 --> 00:01:12.910
Daisuki na ano uta. Ima mo utatte masuka?

00:01:12.910 --> 00:01:20.750
I can still hear that gentle voice and melody

00:01:12.910 --> 00:01:20.750
Watashi ni wa kikoeru. Yasashii koe to melody

00:01:20.750 --> 00:01:30.030
During times of sadness, I will remember you

00:01:20.750 --> 00:01:30.030
Yowaki na toki hodo anata wo omoidasu

00:01:38.420 --> 00:01:39.460
Fujio!

00:01:39.540 --> 00:01:40.710
Let's go out!

00:01:40.800 --> 00:01:42.000
Uh... where?

00:01:42.080 --> 00:01:44.660
You know the new ice cream
parlor near the station...

00:01:44.660 --> 00:01:46.390
we were talking about the other day?

00:01:46.760 --> 00:01:48.660
They gave us coupons.

00:01:48.950 --> 00:01:51.730
There are four of them,
one for you as well.

00:01:52.870 --> 00:01:56.100
Ah, well, um... you know,
I kind of thought...

00:01:56.100 --> 00:01:58.160
maybe I'd do some reading today.

00:01:58.900 --> 00:01:59.990
Reading?!

00:02:00.020 --> 00:02:06.060
10th Period
Bemusing Love Palette

00:02:06.250 --> 00:02:08.440
I'm impressed by Fujio-chan.

00:02:08.960 --> 00:02:11.560
Studying on Sunday.
She's so hard-working, isn't she?

00:02:11.960 --> 00:02:13.890
Hard work is good, but...

00:02:13.890 --> 00:02:16.340
There's definitely something
wrong with that girl.

00:02:16.340 --> 00:02:18.770
Maybe this hot weather
has gone to her head.

00:02:18.900 --> 00:02:19.840
Come to think of it...

00:02:19.840 --> 00:02:22.860
she seemed a little spaced out
during the camping trip, as well.

00:02:23.010 --> 00:02:25.100
Let's get her some ice cream.

00:02:25.160 --> 00:02:25.720
Yeah.

00:02:26.050 --> 00:02:27.050
Yes, we should.

00:02:31.710 --> 00:02:35.430
I'm sorry about this. I've been siting here for 30min and still can't think of any good solution to show this. Please understand!

00:02:31.710 --> 00:02:35.430
Bright
White
Cleaning

00:02:32.070 --> 00:02:35.140
Excuse me, will this express service
be done by the end of the day?

00:02:35.510 --> 00:02:37.660
Your name and address, please.

00:02:40.680 --> 00:02:40.720
Name

00:02:50.100 --> 00:02:51.020
Excuse me.

00:02:51.120 --> 00:02:53.650
I'm Fukae. Is my stuff ready?

00:02:53.890 --> 00:02:54.690
Fukae?!

00:02:55.060 --> 00:02:56.280
Oh, it's you.

00:02:56.420 --> 00:02:58.030
That's no way to say hello!

00:03:00.330 --> 00:03:01.430
Here you are.

00:03:01.650 --> 00:03:02.250
Thanks.

00:03:06.380 --> 00:03:07.060
Oh, no.

00:03:08.010 --> 00:03:09.770
I forgot to give this to him.

00:03:14.340 --> 00:03:15.720
Fukae!

00:03:16.200 --> 00:03:19.050
Fukae! You forgot something!

00:03:26.450 --> 00:03:29.220
I never thought you'd be using
such a pretty handkerchief.

00:03:29.380 --> 00:03:32.500
Small things like these should be washed instead of dry cleaned.

00:03:32.500 --> 00:03:33.570
Why did you do that?!

00:03:35.630 --> 00:03:36.790
You are annoying!

00:03:47.580 --> 00:03:50.000
Bright White Cleaning

00:04:03.460 --> 00:04:05.390
What are you doing over there?

00:04:06.590 --> 00:04:07.220
Hi!

00:04:07.510 --> 00:04:08.660
Bra Man!

00:04:08.760 --> 00:04:10.310
Stop calling me that!

00:04:10.370 --> 00:04:11.460
Why should I?

00:04:11.560 --> 00:04:13.180
Everybody in Gochiso is dubious!

00:04:13.420 --> 00:04:15.070
You and those two men!

00:04:15.120 --> 00:04:16.760
Chinsukou!

00:04:18.320 --> 00:04:19.790
What do you want?

00:04:20.040 --> 00:04:21.570
Do <i>you</i> want to pick me up?!

00:04:21.810 --> 00:04:23.040
I'm not.

00:04:23.450 --> 00:04:25.800
It's just that you looked depressed.

00:04:30.650 --> 00:04:31.970
If you're fine, that's good.

00:04:32.410 --> 00:04:33.080
See you.

00:04:37.880 --> 00:04:38.720
By the way...

00:04:39.470 --> 00:04:42.910
how come men never
think about anything?

00:05:01.200 --> 00:05:04.740
I don't know if that's true.
I think it just appears that way.

00:05:06.030 --> 00:05:06.910
But...

00:05:09.070 --> 00:05:11.160
Are you referring to me?

00:05:11.330 --> 00:05:13.460
I'm the exception.
See, I'm not too bright.

00:05:17.230 --> 00:05:18.960
Oh, there you are, Fujio-chan!

00:05:19.670 --> 00:05:21.230
Were you here the whole time?

00:05:26.820 --> 00:05:29.410
I came looking for you
since you weren't in your room.

00:05:29.770 --> 00:05:31.980
We got you some ice cream.

00:05:32.360 --> 00:05:33.010
Here.

00:05:34.250 --> 00:05:35.940
Thanks, Fuko.

00:05:39.450 --> 00:05:41.160
Yeah, it's melted, but it's good.

00:05:42.030 --> 00:05:42.790
Sorry.

00:05:42.820 --> 00:05:45.230
I should've put more
dry ice in the box.

00:05:45.540 --> 00:05:46.360
Was it crowded?

00:05:46.520 --> 00:05:47.460
Just a little bit.

00:05:47.570 --> 00:05:49.460
You know, Miho-chan was amazing.

00:05:49.660 --> 00:05:53.120
She finished something called
"Triple Mix" that's about this huge.

00:05:57.150 --> 00:05:58.230
Hey, Fuko.

00:05:59.530 --> 00:06:02.880
It's not like me to be depressed.
It's odd, isn't it?

00:06:03.110 --> 00:06:07.350
Not odd, but when you're in a good
mood it puts me in a good mood, too.

00:06:08.650 --> 00:06:11.020
Why?
What's wrong, Fujio-chan?

00:06:11.270 --> 00:06:13.260
Oh nothing.

00:06:27.280 --> 00:06:29.010
What happened to Fujio?

00:06:29.270 --> 00:06:32.460
She looked so glum yesterday
and now this? It's weird.

00:06:32.520 --> 00:06:35.220
Don't worry. She's a very energetic girl.

00:06:35.470 --> 00:06:37.770
Can being energetic be enough though?

00:06:38.310 --> 00:06:38.750
Oh?

00:06:39.590 --> 00:06:41.910
Come on, you guys.
You're being too slow.

00:06:42.170 --> 00:06:43.110
Let's go.

00:06:43.670 --> 00:06:44.950
What, he stood her up?

00:06:44.950 --> 00:06:45.640
Yeah.

00:06:52.280 --> 00:06:53.170
Good morning.

00:06:53.450 --> 00:06:54.150
Hey!

00:06:58.670 --> 00:07:00.120
Good morning, Fukae.

00:07:00.590 --> 00:07:01.160
Yeah.

00:07:19.360 --> 00:07:21.080
Alright then, the next section...

00:07:22.010 --> 00:07:23.890
Fukae-kun, Himejima-san.

00:07:24.030 --> 00:07:26.270
I'm glad you're both
enjoying the soccer game...

00:07:26.270 --> 00:07:28.390
but we're having
a history class now.

00:07:35.360 --> 00:07:36.920
It is unusual for you, Fujio-san...

00:07:37.000 --> 00:07:39.890
to be interested in things
like soccer games.

00:07:40.190 --> 00:07:41.710
Oh, it's fun once in a while.

00:07:41.750 --> 00:07:42.750
That's alright...

00:07:42.750 --> 00:07:46.560
but I feel bad you were treated
like Fukae, of all boys.

00:07:49.080 --> 00:07:49.840
Oh, sorry.

00:07:50.520 --> 00:07:51.470
Take my stuff for me.

00:07:51.680 --> 00:07:52.500
Alright.

00:07:57.020 --> 00:07:58.620
Sorry, you guys go ahead.

00:07:59.490 --> 00:08:00.380
Fujio-chan?

00:08:00.380 --> 00:08:01.230
Sorry!

00:08:02.440 --> 00:08:04.680
Nozaki's phone message is
really laggy, isn't it?

00:08:04.680 --> 00:08:05.590
Totally!

00:08:16.650 --> 00:08:17.440
Sorry.

00:08:49.060 --> 00:08:49.970
Fukae!

00:08:51.590 --> 00:08:52.560
Here!

00:09:51.130 --> 00:09:52.540
But you know...

00:09:52.540 --> 00:09:55.720
there isn't even one male in
our class who's worth mentioning.

00:09:55.900 --> 00:09:57.740
There you go again.

00:09:58.100 --> 00:10:01.610
Especially, the worst of all
without a doubt is Fukae.

00:10:01.930 --> 00:10:06.030
That's not true, Miho-chan.
Fukae-kun is a very nice person.

00:10:06.430 --> 00:10:07.850
You be quiet, Fuko.

00:10:08.040 --> 00:10:09.630
Fujio, don't you think so?

00:10:09.970 --> 00:10:11.760
A guy who plays it cool like that...

00:10:11.760 --> 00:10:14.660
is the least dependable
when you need him most.

00:10:14.730 --> 00:10:15.460
Right?

00:10:15.780 --> 00:10:18.400
So what? I couldn't care less!

00:10:36.710 --> 00:10:39.520
OK then, let's start out
with some stretches.

00:10:39.780 --> 00:10:41.240
Pair up with someone.

00:10:41.240 --> 00:10:42.250
Sensei!

00:10:42.310 --> 00:10:43.270
What is it, Umeda?

00:10:43.770 --> 00:10:46.630
How about making male-female
pairs for a change?

00:10:47.890 --> 00:10:49.620
Sure, it's fine for a change.

00:10:50.140 --> 00:10:53.160
Everybody, form pairs
and start stretching.

00:10:54.210 --> 00:10:55.430
What are you doing?

00:10:55.430 --> 00:10:57.380
Silly, it's a good chance!

00:10:59.100 --> 00:11:00.420
Have fun.

00:11:04.900 --> 00:11:12.020
One-two-three.

00:11:22.900 --> 00:11:23.900
Sensei?

00:11:24.210 --> 00:11:26.230
Uh, Kuzuha, you can go further.

00:11:26.620 --> 00:11:29.810
Here, stretch your arms
and try grabbing your toes.

00:11:29.920 --> 00:11:31.060
Uh, yes.

00:11:31.320 --> 00:11:33.480
Yes, that's good.

00:11:34.000 --> 00:11:36.570
I wonder if I really am weird.

00:11:37.220 --> 00:11:40.460
Just by being near Hibiki-sensei,
my heart is...

00:11:49.020 --> 00:11:49.480
Hey.

00:11:50.000 --> 00:11:51.400
Uh, yeah...

00:12:02.740 --> 00:12:03.800
Doteyaki!

00:12:05.550 --> 00:12:08.710
What's up with you, making
me change in such a hurry?

00:12:08.760 --> 00:12:10.100
Just wait.

00:12:14.190 --> 00:12:16.380
Write a note telling
him to meet you.

00:12:17.450 --> 00:12:19.900
Come on, before everyone
else gets back.

00:12:25.330 --> 00:12:27.490
What are you doing? Write.

00:12:27.770 --> 00:12:30.510
But I've never written
anything like this before.

00:12:31.830 --> 00:12:35.890
When it comes to things like this,
you really are an amateur, aren't you?

00:12:36.320 --> 00:12:36.980
Yeah...

00:12:39.770 --> 00:12:42.950
Look, it's just a note
telling him to come meet you.

00:12:43.260 --> 00:12:45.680
No need for fancy stuff
or even your name.

00:12:45.930 --> 00:12:48.270
Just jot down the message.

00:12:48.580 --> 00:12:50.580
Dear Sir.

00:12:50.630 --> 00:12:50.930
Hey.

00:12:50.930 --> 00:12:51.370
Ouch.

00:13:02.210 --> 00:13:02.760
Here.

00:13:11.770 --> 00:13:14.770
Love is All

00:13:29.090 --> 00:13:30.290
Is something wrong?

00:13:30.390 --> 00:13:31.520
No, nothing.

00:13:31.750 --> 00:13:33.340
The first hurdle cleared.

00:13:34.460 --> 00:13:35.170
Yeah.

00:13:48.440 --> 00:13:49.470
Could it be?

00:13:52.700 --> 00:13:55.280
Alright, let's start the homeroom.

00:14:08.790 --> 00:14:16.140
Dear Sir, Fukae-kun, please come to the rooftop access from the old stairs, after classes today.

00:14:16.140 --> 00:14:19.210
I'll be waiting for you.
So be sure...

00:14:19.210 --> 00:14:22.010
to come!

00:14:24.170 --> 00:14:32.430
Chinatown

00:14:24.450 --> 00:14:25.630
Butaman!

00:14:26.260 --> 00:14:29.690
Kochi-san, this trip has been fun,
but it's almost over.

00:14:29.850 --> 00:14:31.780
You're right, Mori-chan.

00:14:32.330 --> 00:14:36.010
But what did we set
out for to begin with?

00:14:36.530 --> 00:14:38.180
I don't remember...

00:14:38.490 --> 00:14:41.630
Look Miho, I don't
think it's going to work.

00:14:41.690 --> 00:14:43.990
He's going to ignore
a note like that.

00:14:44.310 --> 00:14:46.340
What are you saying?
You've come this far.

00:14:46.390 --> 00:14:47.190
But...

00:14:47.510 --> 00:14:51.110
How are you going to profess your
love with that attitude?

00:14:51.290 --> 00:14:53.810
You’re just asking
for failure, you know?

00:14:54.710 --> 00:14:55.700
I know.

00:14:55.970 --> 00:14:57.170
I know, but...

00:15:04.100 --> 00:15:05.320
Be confident.

00:15:05.810 --> 00:15:10.780
You're the most beautiful, sweet,
and popular 14 year-old in the world.

00:15:10.950 --> 00:15:12.030
After me of course, OK?

00:15:12.470 --> 00:15:12.980
OK.

00:15:19.550 --> 00:15:20.930
You came.

00:15:22.410 --> 00:15:24.200
What do you want?

00:15:24.540 --> 00:15:27.930
Not me. I just wrote the note.

00:15:29.490 --> 00:15:30.300
Be nice.

00:15:30.820 --> 00:15:34.460
My pure-hearted and beautiful best
friend is up there waiting for you.

00:16:01.740 --> 00:16:03.010
Kuzuha...

00:16:13.120 --> 00:16:15.300
Hime... jima?!

00:16:35.480 --> 00:16:37.880
Um, thanks for coming.

00:16:38.440 --> 00:16:41.870
I wanted to tell you when
I returned your sweatshirt...

00:16:42.130 --> 00:16:43.820
but when things turned out badly...

00:16:45.910 --> 00:16:47.440
Fukae-kun.

00:17:03.450 --> 00:17:04.330
I like you.

00:17:04.810 --> 00:17:09.100
If it's OK with you,
please be my boyfriend.

00:17:21.790 --> 00:17:23.630
I'm sorry, Himejima.

00:17:25.690 --> 00:17:29.170
I'm in love with someone else.

00:18:01.250 --> 00:18:02.450
Fukae-kun!

00:18:03.710 --> 00:18:04.640
Kuzuha!

00:18:05.020 --> 00:18:07.120
Have you seen Fujio-chan anywhere?

00:18:17.150 --> 00:18:18.620
Fukae-kun?

00:18:21.510 --> 00:18:22.280
Kuzuha.

00:18:22.710 --> 00:18:23.330
Here.

00:18:24.280 --> 00:18:27.090
Oh, from the camping trip?
Thanks for taking the trouble.

00:18:36.360 --> 00:18:37.380
Look.

00:18:40.430 --> 00:18:41.100
I...

00:18:49.050 --> 00:18:50.260
I like you, Kuzuha.

00:18:50.810 --> 00:18:52.110
Please be my girlfriend.

00:19:06.420 --> 00:19:07.610
Tah-dah!

00:19:09.130 --> 00:19:12.060
My once-a-year treat!

00:19:13.770 --> 00:19:14.630
Fujio?

00:19:25.390 --> 00:19:25.470
Seitou Sannomiya Gakuin Chuutoubu   2nd year Indigo class

00:19:25.390 --> 00:19:26.650
Name

00:19:25.390 --> 00:19:25.470
Gender

00:19:25.390 --> 00:19:25.690
Fuko Kuzuha

00:19:25.390 --> 00:19:26.650
Academic
Achievements

00:19:25.390 --> 00:19:26.650
Attitude and Behavior

00:19:25.390 --> 00:19:25.550
Family

00:19:25.390 --> 00:19:26.650
Overall Remarks

00:19:49.820 --> 00:19:50.700
Rain...

00:20:01.990 --> 00:20:03.520
It started raining after all.

00:20:04.520 --> 00:20:05.310
Kuzuha...

00:20:21.240 --> 00:20:24.270
Would you give me an answer, please.

00:20:50.710 --> 00:20:52.770
What am I doing?

00:20:59.980 --> 00:21:00.640
I...

00:21:00.760 --> 00:21:01.930
I'm sorry.

00:21:03.640 --> 00:21:05.840
I think I'm...

00:21:11.370 --> 00:21:18.120
At the train station after school
that's where I look for you

00:21:11.370 --> 00:21:18.120
Hokago no eki kimi wo sagasu.

00:21:18.230 --> 00:21:27.480
With my racing heart
can I find you again today?

00:21:18.230 --> 00:21:27.480
Doki doki shiteru
kyo mo aeru kana?

00:21:42.650 --> 00:21:49.440
At this train station
I saw you many times before

00:21:42.650 --> 00:21:49.440
Eki no homu de
mikakete ta kimi.

00:21:49.600 --> 00:21:56.330
But couldn't talk to you
Not at all

00:21:49.600 --> 00:21:56.330
Hajime wa nanimo hanase nakatta.

00:21:56.480 --> 00:22:03.180
Will I find you again tomorrow?

00:21:56.480 --> 00:22:03.180
Moshimo ashita aetara iina?

00:22:03.320 --> 00:22:11.160
Maybe I'll have enough
courage to talk to you

00:22:03.320 --> 00:22:11.160
Youki dashite ieru kamone.

00:22:11.350 --> 00:22:18.290
Even if the sky cries

00:22:11.350 --> 00:22:18.290
Tatoeba sora ga namida shitemo...

00:22:18.290 --> 00:22:27.130
with your smile it's
a sunny day in my eyes

00:22:18.290 --> 00:22:27.130
kimi no egao de hitomi wa hareru yo.

00:22:38.380 --> 00:22:53.440
11th Period "Fragrance Heart to Adulthood"

00:22:38.660 --> 00:22:39.450
Hey Sensei.

00:22:39.450 --> 00:22:43.100
You know that love umbrella hidden on the left side of the blackboard?

00:22:43.100 --> 00:22:45.290
Don't you wanna know whose name's next to yours?

00:22:45.290 --> 00:22:46.470
I'm gonna take a peek!

00:22:46.550 --> 00:22:48.720
Hey, Umeda!
No! Please don't!

00:22:48.720 --> 00:22:51.260
You've gotta be kidding!
Why this person?

00:22:51.260 --> 00:22:52.750
What? Who!? Who is it!?
